--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+## Unreleased
+
+- Subcommands look up their defaults in `default_map` under their own name,
+  for example `{"runserver": {"port": 5000}}`. Previously the whole parent
+  `default_map` was passed down, so nested subcommand defaults were ignored.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
